        "type": "text/plain",
        "value": "<div>\r\n  <img src=\"https://irp.cdn-website.com/002b888d/dms3rep/multi/2025+Pre+season.jpg\" alt=\"\"/>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa is thrilled to once again host the highly anticipated preseason tournament! Since 2017, we've been bringing together the country's top teams for a weekend of intense competition, and this year promises to be bigger and better than ever. \u00a0\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n            \u00a0 \u00a0\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n            Join us as we welcome some of the best netball teams from around New Zealand: \u00a0\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n            \u00a0 \u00a0\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n             The VIP Tactix (Christchurch)\u00a0\n             \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n             AVIS Waikato Bay of Plenty Magic (Hamilton) \u00a0\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n             Northern Mystics (Auckland) \u00a0\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n             Ascot Park Hotel Southern Steel (Invercargill) \u00a0\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n             Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa Pulse (Wellington) \u00a0\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n            \u00a0 \u00a0\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n            But that's not all! This year, we're excited to add an extra special opening match to the schedule: the Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa Pulse will take on the Pulse Men's team in a thrilling showdown. \u00a0\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n            \u00a0 \u00a0\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n            At Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa, we're all about whakawhanaungatanga (relationship building) and fostering a sense of community. Our marae-style hospitality will make our visiting teams feel right at home, with plenty of opportunities to bond with their opponents and enjoy some friendly rivalry. \u00a0\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n            \u00a0 \u00a0\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n            Want to stay up-to-date on the tournament action or purchase tickets? Head to\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <a href=\"https://www.wananga.com/pre-season-netball-tournament-2025\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      \n           https://www.wananga.com/pre-season-netball-tournament-2025\n          \r\n    </a>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0 for all the latest info!\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>"
      }
    ],
